Third-party components
----------------------

The released checkpoint (artifacts/best_model_refit.pth) contains an image
branch (a ResNet-18 through layer4, whose layer2 and layer3 the per-cell
head also reads) that was INITIALISED from torchvision's
ImageNet-pretrained ResNet-18 (resnet18, IMAGENET1K_V1 weights) and then
fine-tuned (README items 2 and 5), so its weights are derived from, but
not verbatim copies of, the torchvision parameters. Its BatchNorm running
statistics are kept frozen during training, so they equal the pretrained
ones up to weight-EMA floating-point rounding (at most 2e-4 absolute;
README items 2 and 9). The label branch, the fully connected classifier
and the per-cell head (README items 2 and 4) are trained from their
default (random or zero) initialisation by the code in this folder.
